  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 101.01 Purpose of Rules. These rules provide a procedure for determination of the amount of the decommissioning financing fund for each nuclear electric generating facility and the schedule of payments of monies into the fund by the owner or owners of each such nuclear electric generating facility.\n\nSource. #4235, eff 2-20-87, EXPIRED: 2-20-93\n\nNew. #5700, INTERIM, eff 9-17-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-94\n\nNew. #5824, eff 8-30-94, EXPIRED: 8-30-00\n\nNew. #7366, INTERIM, eff 9-18-00, EXPIRED: 3-17-01\n\nNew. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/dec100-200.html"
